    {
      "id": "claim_3f8522b559f84e7bb5efae44d738d5ae",
      "statement": "MyfeederProperties implements Spring's Validator interface so Boot's configuration-properties binder self-validates it on startup, refusing startup with fixed text (ENGAGEMENT_INVALID, SUGGESTIONS_INVALID) when the interest-blend engagement constants or the gap-discovery near-miss threshold are out of their valid ranges.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/config/MyfeederProperties.java#L11-L43",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:01b9b69ca1c16b6a6c7535c110f6ff0dd00972af4eb9d601d2ecea5726efedda:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_dbd485ba6e6041629d2e8114a47c5c6a",
      "statement": "GlobalExceptionHandler maps JevNotConfiguredException to 503 ('Jev not configured'), Resilience4j's CallNotPermittedException to 503 ('Jev unavailable', when the jev circuit breaker is open), TypeSafeBadRequestException/TypeSafeUnprocessableEntityException to 422 ('Jev rejected the request'), and any other TypeSafeException to 503 ('Jev request failed'); every Jev-related ProblemDetail detail is fixed app text and never echoes the underlying TypeSafe exception's message or body.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/controller/GlobalExceptionHandler.java#L71-L105",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:edf5da9e2c8d1bfa5d6987cddad840f1c110953af343b4a736ff921ea722b28c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_85835b75f1504c39a2039db69f33c7dd",
      "statement": "The REST API surface now also includes /api/interest (profile, topics, status, preview, rescore, topic suggestions) alongside /api/feeds, /api/articles, /api/integrations, /api/opml, /api/boards, /api/folders.",
